        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jensen%2C_Utah",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Lars Jensen began operating a ferry on the Green River in 1885, helping pioneer river crossings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
