      ],
      "source": "https://onlineutah.us/jensenuintahhistory.shtml",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jensen lies along the Green River and U.S. Route 40, southeast of Vernal and 17 miles west of Colorado.",
